// "creatures you control have total power 8 or greater" — a `SumOf` fold
// over each controlled creature's power. A `Condition`-kind macro for an
// `ActivatedAbility`'s "Activate only if …" rider. `Aggregate(SumOf, (of:
// …, by: StatOf(It, Power)))` is the same "total power" idiom `count.rs`'s
// own doc example uses.
(
    name: "CreaturesYouControlHaveTotalPowerEightOrGreater",
    template: "creatures you control have total power 8 or greater",
    kinds: [Condition],
    body: Compare(
        Aggregate(SumOf, (of: Objects(And([InZone(Battlefield), Type("Creature"), ControlledBy(Ref(You))])), by: StatOf(It, Power))),
        AtLeast,
        8,
    ),
)
